{
    "name": "Open vSwitch",
    "category": "switch",
    "description": "Open vSwitch (OVS) is a production-quality multilayer virtual switch. Supports VLANs (802.1Q), STP/RSTP, LACP, VXLAN, OpenFlow, and QoS. Use as a managed L2/L3 switch in lab topologies without KVM.",
    "vendor_name": "Open vSwitch",
